name: A confirmed observation creates only an unaccepted source-pattern draft under a finite allowance
size: 120x36
cwd: @TMP_TARGET
env-unset: ANTHROPIC_API_KEY OPENAI_API_KEY KUZUSHI_MODEL KUZUSHI_LANGGRAPH_BRIDGE NODE_OPTIONS NO_COLOR KUZUSHI_SKIP_ONBOARDING
env: HOME=@TMP_HOME KUZUSHI_REDUCED_MOTION=1 KUZUSHI_BRIDGE_DEBUG_DUMP=@ART/bridge-metadata.json
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/variant_draft.py seed @TMP_TARGET @ART @TMP_HOME
require-wrapper-flow:
launch: --target @TMP_TARGET
require-live-snap: 30 REVIEW || READY THE MAP RUN || KUZUSHI | ready
submit: setg ui.auto_open_activity false
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/variant_draft.py before @TMP_TARGET @ART
paste-file: @ART/command.txt
keys: Enter
require-live-snap: 30 Unaccepted source-pattern draft | draft-produced
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/variant_draft.py draft @TMP_TARGET @ART
paste-file: @ART/replay.txt
keys: Enter
require-live-snap: 20 Outcome · completed | draft-receipt
expect: Unaccepted source-pattern draft
ask: Is the result clearly an unaccepted draft with a preserved human confirmation, one budgeted request, and separate lesson review/context reuse or discovery actions?
resize: 160x48
live-snap: draft-160x48
resize: 96x89
live-snap: draft-96x89
resize: 80x24
live-snap: draft-80x24
resize: 60x20
live-snap: draft-60x20
resize: 40x12
require-live-snap: 20 Outcome · completed | draft-40x12
expect: Unaccepted
keys: NPage
live-snap: draft-page-1-40x12
keys: NPage
live-snap: draft-page-2-40x12
ask: Are the draft warning, signature, remaining allowance and no-continuation state readable through paging without implying acceptance?
resize: 120x36
keys: C-c
require-exit: 10
env: HOME=@TMP_HOME KUZUSHI_REDUCED_MOTION=1 NO_COLOR=1
launch: --target @TMP_TARGET
require-live-snap: 30 REVIEW || READY THE MAP RUN || KUZUSHI | resumed
paste-file: @ART/replay.txt
keys: Enter
require-live-snap: 20 Outcome · completed | recovered
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/variant_draft.py restart @TMP_TARGET @ART
ask: Does restart retain the same unaccepted draft and original context/decision history without another model request or additional discovery?
keys: C-c
require-exit: 10
